text = "Welcome to the stockroom!

Working back here is boring. Why not ride on the electric pallet jack?

There are two main things to look out for in the stockroom: BOXES and RAMPS.

                            [img]res://graphics/box.png[/img][img]res://graphics/ramp.png[/img]

BOXES are dangerous—press Z to dodge them. 

RAMPS are for hitting sweet jumps! Press X while in the air to do a flip for bonus points, but make sure to stick the landing!

The further you go, the more points you earn. Use those points to upgrade your pallet jack's POWER, SPEED, and DURABILITY stats."

